# Copy to `.env` for local dev; `pnpm dev` / `pnpm console` load this
# automatically via Node's `--env-file-if-exists=.env`. The file is
# gitignored — never commit secrets.

# Required for `pnpm dev` — Hindsight uses Anthropic for memory extraction.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# --- Test fixture recording -------------------------------------------------
# Each integration-tier mock flips to record mode when the matching env flag
# is set AND the matching upstream key is present, otherwise it replays from
# `test/fixtures/*`. CI never sets these; record once locally, commit fixture,
# CI replays for free.

# `LLMOCK_RECORD=1 pnpm test:record` — proxies Anthropic/OpenAI traffic via
# llmock to the real upstreams. Uses ANTHROPIC_API_KEY above (plus
# OPENAI_API_KEY below for Hindsight's embedding model).
# LLMOCK_RECORD=1

# `RECORD=1 pnpm test:integration` — flips fal-mock, openai-voice-mock, AND
# daytona-mock into record mode for the current run. Each guards on its own
# upstream key below; missing keys → that fixture is skipped.
# RECORD=1

# fal.ai (image generation) — needed by RECORD=1 for the image-gen tests in
# pipeline.integration.test.ts. Replay uses a dummy "test-fal-key".
# FAL_API_KEY=...

# OpenAI (voice TTS/STT + Hindsight embeddings) — needed by RECORD=1 for the
# voice flow in pipeline.integration.test.ts, and by LLMOCK_RECORD=1 for
# Hindsight's `text-embedding-3-small` calls.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...

# OpenRouter (xAI / Grok) — needed by scripts/record-xai-fixture.ts only.
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-...

# Daytona (managed sandbox backend) — needed by RECORD=1 for
# src/test/daytona-conformance.integration.test.ts when capturing the
# Cogmo→Daytona wire fixture. Replay uses dummy "test-key".
# DAYTONA_API_KEY=dty_...
# DAYTONA_API_URL=https://app.daytona.io/api
# DAYTONA_ORGANIZATION_ID=...
